      "name": "Greenleaf Online Shop",
      "summary": "A small fictional e-commerce business, Greenleaf Online Shop, stores its data in a relational database with a customers table and an orders table. Learners query these tables to practise SELECT, aliasing, DISTINCT and basic data-quality checks.",
